OL,3,ADrumcree parade decision expected to be
OL,4,Aannounced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision on whether or not a
OL,7,Fcontroversial Drumcree parade by the
OL,8,FOrange Order in Portadown is to be
OL,9,Fre-routed may be announced later on
OL,10,FFriday.
OL,12,FThe Parades Commission has been
OL,13,Fdeliberating since Wednesday on whether
OL,14,Fthe parade will be allowed along the
OL,15,Fmainly nationalist Garvaghy Road.
OL,17,FUnionist politicians have urged the
OL,18,Ffive-person commission to permit
OL,19,FSunday's march in spite of opposition
OL,20,Ffrom a group of local residents.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
